{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"8febfdfa53c47b5e","type":"text","x":-420,"y":-80,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"6","text":"# 从 RankMixer 到 OneRanker\n2025—2026 大厂搜推大模型技术路线"},
		{"id":"45050ce7d4aa9a92","type":"link","x":-420,"y":120,"width":320,"height":120,"url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2018371788569096345"},
		{"id":"de336ad73ae43c80","type":"text","x":20,"y":-460,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"## 导语\n大模型化进入产业深水区，四个层面同步发生"},
		{"id":"1636574397e455d3","type":"text","x":440,"y":-460,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"观察窗口：字节 RankMixer → OneTrans → TRM → MDL → MixFormer；外部 SORT / MTFM / OneRec / GPR / OneRanker / GR4AD / OxygenREC"},
		{"id":"9361cd9f78b48610","type":"text","x":20,"y":-324,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"## 一、总体判断\n四条主线并行推进"},
		{"id":"2ad72b6bf6d65d6c","type":"text","x":440,"y":-324,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"主线一 · 大 ranking backbone 可扩展化\nRankMixer、TokenMixer-Large、MSN、UG-Separation、SORT、MTmixAtt"},
		{"id":"411c9d418e76e8b6","type":"text","x":440,"y":-200,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"主线二 · 长序列建模工业化\nLONGER、STCA、LEMUR、LASER、腾讯广告、LinkedIn Feed-SR"},
		{"id":"cd7e7578f634be0d","type":"text","x":440,"y":-76,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"主线三 · 统一 backbone\nOneTrans、MixFormer、HoMer、MDL、MTFM"},
		{"id":"24f58cce706d0097","type":"text","x":440,"y":48,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"主线四 · semantic token 与生成式 one-model\nTRM、MERGE、OneRec、OneLoc、OneMall、GR4AD、GRank、GPR、OneRanker、OxygenREC"},
		{"id":"e698b1c54c1f1c25","type":"text","x":20,"y":-188,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"## 二、字节跳动技术链条"},
		{"id":"70a6106cc85e9230","type":"text","x":440,"y":-188,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"1. RankMixer\n排序主干改造为可扩展对象"},
		{"id":"b12ab274e3484e8c","type":"text","x":440,"y":-64,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"2. TokenMixer-Large / MSN / UG-Separation\n围绕 RankMixer 的三种补强路径"},
		{"id":"adea622fbb7ffd82","type":"text","x":440,"y":60,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"3. STCA / LEMUR\n长序列与多模态的工业化支柱"},
		{"id":"bd01beb6e09648d8","type":"text","x":440,"y":184,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"4. OneTrans / MixFormer / MDL\n进入统一化阶段"},
		{"id":"c70334f97d506c13","type":"text","x":440,"y":308,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"5. TRM / MERGE\n输入表征与索引层同步改写"},
		{"id":"743cf00deee0e45d","type":"text","x":20,"y":-52,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"## 三、外部大厂最新工作"},
		{"id":"da4a2affab160b3f","type":"text","x":440,"y":-52,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"1. 阿里 · SORT\n判别式大 ranking backbone 的重要对照"},
		{"id":"45db54c831aa8530","type":"text","x":440,"y":72,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"2. 美团 · MTFM / MTmixAtt / MTGR / UniROM-EGA\n同时推进统一 foundation model 与生成式"},
		{"id":"9ee2ee6332b7830f","type":"text","x":440,"y":196,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"3. 腾讯 · GPR / OneRanker\n生成式广告 one-model 结构深融合"},
		{"id":"6cf7e629452763e3","type":"text","x":440,"y":320,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"4. 快手 · OneRec / OneLoc / OneMall / GR4AD / GRank / PROMISE\n平台级生成式体系"},
		{"id":"568ae65fb3b650aa","type":"text","x":440,"y":444,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"5. 小红书 / LinkedIn / Meta / 京东\nRankGPT、LASER、Feed-SR、Foundation-Expert、OxygenREC"},
		{"id":"4bedc429444484a8","type":"text","x":20,"y":84,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"## 四、综合观察\n五个明确趋势"},
		{"id":"6b2caf0ee904925c","type":"text","x":440,"y":84,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"趋势一 · 判别式大 ranking 进入成熟阶段"},
		{"id":"d0120ea07ee03c8b","type":"text","x":440,"y":208,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"趋势二 · 生成式 one-model 加速落地（广告 / 电商 / 多场景）"},
		{"id":"03f678459ecaf317","type":"text","x":440,"y":332,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"趋势三 · semantic token 上升为系统级接口"},
		{"id":"c571cd2be28280af","type":"text","x":440,"y":456,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"趋势四 · serving / 复用 / inference-time scaling 成为一等公民"},
		{"id":"166ed43c4f300b9e","type":"text","x":440,"y":580,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"趋势五 · 统一化：统一分布、统一目标、统一平台"},
		{"id":"9c9616fc5609d172","type":"text","x":20,"y":220,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"4","text":"## 五、结论\n分水岭：三类统一接口"},
		{"id":"382d5d070110d338","type":"text","x":440,"y":220,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"统一的 token 接口\nitem / 广告 / 内容 / 地理 / 场景 / 任务"},
		{"id":"eaae2e7c038708fd","type":"text","x":440,"y":344,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"统一的 backbone 接口\n承接 sequence / feature / scenario / task / value"},
		{"id":"455f9e01df7af44f","type":"text","x":440,"y":468,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"统一的在线推理接口\n训练 / 蒸馏 / 缓存 / 复用 / beam search / 近线 reasoning"},
		{"id":"affe2e3b50cd8652","type":"text","x":20,"y":356,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"5","text":"## 结语\n从「模型更大」到「接口重写」"},
		{"id":"8554a67b074c3ff1","type":"text","x":440,"y":356,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2","text":"真正的问题不再是「是否做推荐大模型」，而是哪一层先完成 token 化、哪一段先完成统一、哪块先完成生成式重写"},
		{"id":"8625ae99b80bd875","type":"file","x":960,"y":-188,"width":280,"height":180,"file":"Recsys/RankMixer_论文解读.md"},
		{"id":"49124efa40ef9b11","type":"file","x":960,"y":-64,"width":280,"height":180,"file":"Recsys/TokenMixer-Large_论文解读.md"},
		{"id":"45ce88eb369528b9","type":"file","x":960,"y":136,"width":280,"height":180,"file":"Recsys/MSN_论文解读.md"}
	],
